OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G1/7 
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCBBC begins Met Office weather     
OL,4,Cpartnership as national bulletins are  
OL,5,Ccut back                               
OL,7,FThe Met Office has returned as the     
OL,8,Fsource of the BBC's weather forecasts, 
OL,9,Feight years after the previous         
OL,10,Farrangement between the two            
OL,11,Forganisations came to an end.          
OL,13,FThe new partnership took effect on 26th
OL,14,FNovember 2026, having been announced in
OL,15,FJuly 2025.                             
OL,17,FSince 2018, the BBC's forecast data has
OL,18,Fbeen supplied by MeteoGroup, a Dutch   
OL,19,Fcompany later acquired by the US firm  
OL,20,FDTN.                                   
OL,23,EPub: 26-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
