OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 141 Thu 26 NovC04:11/29
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G2/7 
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCBBC begins Met Office weather     
OL,4,Cpartnership as national bulletins are  
OL,5,Ccut back                               
OL,7,GCHANGES FOR AUDIENCES                  
OL,9,FMuch of the change will be seen online.
OL,11,FThe BBC News website and app are       
OL,12,Fgaining an hourly forecast that runs   
OL,13,Ffor 10 days, with improved medium-range
OL,14,Fforecasting, while users of the BBC    
OL,15,FWeather app will receive Met Office    
OL,16,Fsevere weather warnings as             
OL,17,Fnotifications.                         
OL,19,FThe BBC also says there will be more   
OL,20,Flocal weather reports, more of them    
OL,21,Fpresented by local weather presenters, 
OL,22,Fand more digital forecasts overall.    
OL,23,EPub: 26-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,142,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14103
SC,0003
PS,C000
CT,5,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 141 Thu 26 NovC04:11/29
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G3/7 
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCBBC begins Met Office weather     
OL,4,Cpartnership as national bulletins are  
OL,5,Ccut back                               
OL,7,FForecasts will now carry Met Office    
OL,8,Fbranding, and the BBC is opening a     
OL,9,Fweather centre within the Met Office's 
OL,10,FExeter headquarters. The two           
OL,11,Forganisations also plan to produce more
OL,12,Fcontent together explaining weather and
OL,13,Fclimate.                               
OL,15,FBBC Director General Matt Brittin said 
OL,16,Fthe partnership was about providing    
OL,17,F"the most accurate, reliable and       
OL,18,Fhelpful weather service we can". Penny 
OL,19,FEndersby, the Met Office's Chief       
OL,20,FExecutive, called it "a landmark       
OL,21,Fmoment" that would bring its forecasts 
OL,22,Fto a wider audience across the UK.     
OL,23,EPub: 26-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,142,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14104
SC,0004
PS,C000
CT,5,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 141 Thu 26 NovC04:11/29
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G4/7 
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCBBC begins Met Office weather     
OL,4,Cpartnership as national bulletins are  
OL,5,Ccut back                               
OL,7,GCUTS TO BROADCAST BULLETINS            
OL,9,FThe launch coincides with reductions to
OL,10,Fthe BBC's national weather output on   
OL,11,Ftelevision and radio, made in recent   
OL,12,Fweeks as part of the corporation's     
OL,13,Fdrive to save #500m.                   
OL,15,FThe BBC says the Met Office deal is    
OL,16,Fseparate from those cuts and was       
OL,17,Fannounced before the latest savings    
OL,18,Fround began.                           
OL,23,EPub: 26-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,142,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14105
SC,0005
PS,C000
CT,5,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 141 Thu 26 NovC04:11/29
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G5/7 
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCBBC begins Met Office weather     
OL,4,Cpartnership as national bulletins are  
OL,5,Ccut back                               
OL,7,FThe main national forecasts on Radio   
OL,8,F4's Today, BBC Breakfast and the       
OL,9,Fweekday BBC News at Six on BBC One are 
OL,10,Funaffected.                            
OL,12,FElsewhere, however, some weekend and   
OL,13,Flate-night TV forecasts have gone.     
OL,14,FRegional weather presenters now cover  
OL,15,Fthe outlook for the whole of the UK as 
OL,16,Fpart of their own broadcasts.          
OL,23,EPub: 26-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,142,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14106
SC,0006
PS,C000
CT,5,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 141 Thu 26 NovC04:11/29
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G6/7 
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCBBC begins Met Office weather     
OL,4,Cpartnership as national bulletins are  
OL,5,Ccut back                               
OL,7,FThere have also been complaints from   
OL,8,Flisteners to Radio 4's PM, which has   
OL,9,Freplaced its full forecast with a short
OL,10,Fsummary read by presenter Evan Davis,  
OL,11,Fwho directs listeners online for       
OL,12,Ffurther detail.                        
OL,14,FThe BBC said the restructuring of its  
OL,15,Fweather team follows audience research 
OL,16,Fshowing a shift away from broadcast    
OL,17,Fbulletins towards its app, website and 
OL,18,Fsocial media channels.                 
OL,23,EPub: 26-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,142,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14107
SC,0007
PS,C000
CT,5,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 141 Thu 26 NovC04:11/29
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G7/7 
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCBBC begins Met Office weather     
OL,4,Cpartnership as national bulletins are  
OL,5,Ccut back                               
OL,7,FExplaining the changes, a BBC spokesman
OL,8,Fsaid: "As we announced in July, we are 
OL,9,Fmaking changes to the way we deliver   
OL,10,Fweather information as more people are 
OL,11,Fturning to mobile and the website for  
OL,12,Ftheir weather forecasts."              
OL,14,FHe said audiences had also asked for   
OL,15,Fmore local forecasts as well as the    
OL,16,Fnational picture, and that the BBC was 
OL,17,F"ensuring we still have appropriate    
OL,18,Fnational weather bulletins across the  
OL,19,FTV and radio".                         
OL,23,EPub: 26-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
